1     indf3lcc  no       INDEFINITE_ANNOTATION_END      feature      2     2  all       0      0  alignment to homology model has low confidence at 3' boundary for feature that is or matches a CDS
#---  --------  -------  -----------------------------  -------  -----  ----  -----  ----  -----  -----------
2     mutendcd  yes      MUTATION_AT_END                feature      3     3  -         3      0  expected stop codon could not be identified, predicted CDS stop by homology is invalid
3     mutendns  yes      MUTATION_AT_END                feature      3     3  -         3      0  expected stop codon could not be identified, no in-frame stop codon exists 3' of predicted start codon
4     mutendex  yes      MUTATION_AT_END                feature      2     2  -         2      0  expected stop codon could not be identified, first in-frame stop codon exists 3' of predicted stop position
5     unexleng  yes      UNEXPECTED_LENGTH              feature      9     5  -         5      0  length of complete coding (CDS or mat_peptide) feature is not a multiple of 3
6     cdsstopn  yes      CDS_HAS_STOP_CODON             feature      3     3  -         3      0  in-frame stop codon exists 5' of stop position predicted by homology to reference
7     fsthicft  yes      POSSIBLE_FRAMESHIFT_HIGH_CONF  feature      7     5  -         5      0  high confidence possible frameshift in CDS (frame not restored before end)
8     fsthicfi  yes      POSSIBLE_FRAMESHIFT_HIGH_CONF  feature      2     1  -         1      0  high confidence possible frameshift in CDS (frame restored before end)
9     peptrans  yes      PEPTIDE_TRANSLATION_PROBLEM    feature      6     3  -         3      0  mat_peptide may not be translated because its parent CDS has a problem
10    indf5gap  yes      INDEFINITE_ANNOTATION_START    feature      7     5  -         5      0  alignment to homology model is a gap at 5' boundary
11    indf3gap  yes      INDEFINITE_ANNOTATION_END      feature      5     5  -         5      0  alignment to homology model is a gap at 3' boundary
